  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Honey_Bee?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c3/Honey_Bee.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025204515\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Honey bee\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honey bee\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Honey bee</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Animal</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 39</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1,500 to 3,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gives </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Honeycomb</span><span title=\"Honeycomb\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/honeycomb-15787\" title=\"Honeycomb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Honeycomb\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7c/Honeycomb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/35?cb=20191025193524\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  every ≈35 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Honey bees</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/farm-15139\" title=\"Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">farm</a> <a href=\"/wiki/animals-3602\" title=\"Animals\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">animals</a> which produce <a href=\"/wiki/honeycomb-15787\" title=\"Honeycomb\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">honeycomb</a>. They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 39. They are the sixth type of farm animal unlocked in the game.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHoney_Bee.png\" title=\"Honey Bee.png (160 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c3/Honey_Bee.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025204515\" title=\"Honey Bee.png (160 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Honey Bee.png (160 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHoney_Bee_Flying_Down.png\" title=\"Honey Bee Flying Down.png (173 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f5/Honey_Bee_Flying_Down.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025204537\" title=\"Honey Bee Flying Down.png (173 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Honey Bee Flying Down.png (173 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHoney_Bee_Flying_Up.png\" title=\"Honey Bee Flying Up.png (169 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2b/Honey_Bee_Flying_Up.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025204533\" title=\"Honey Bee Flying Up.png (169 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Honey Bee Flying Up.png (169 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHoney_Bee_Full.png\" title=\"Honey Bee Full.png (192 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Honey_Bee_Full.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191025204432\" title=\"Honey Bee Full.png (192 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Honey Bee Full.png (192 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHoney_Bee_Summer.png\" title=\"Honey Bee Summer.png (21 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a6/Honey_Bee_Summer.png/revision/latest?cb=20160622084313\" title=\"Honey Bee Summer.png (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Honey Bee Summer\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Honey Bee Summer.png (21 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Honey Bee Summer\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Honey Bee Summer</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHoney_Bee_Winter.png\" title=\"Honey Bee Winter.png (477 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/39/Honey_Bee_Winter.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/153?cb=20260530211832\" title=\"Honey Bee Winter.png (477 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Honey Bee Winter\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Honey Bee Winter.png (477 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Honey Bee Winter\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\">Honey Bee Winter</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Alternate appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/themes-25920\" title=\"Themes\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Themes</a></i>\n</p><p>Honey bees wear themed accessories during summer, Halloween and winter.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Buying</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/d/de/Beehive_Tree_Stage_4.png/revision/latest?cb=20150713112031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Beehive tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Beehive tree\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Beehive tree</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Honey bees must be placed in a <a href=\"/wiki/beehive-tree-15804\" title=\"Beehive Tree\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">beehive tree</a> to be purchased. The tree costs 4,000 <a href=\"/wiki/coin-6079\" title=\"Coin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">coins</a>. The tree has room for one beehive and three bees at first. At this point bees cost 1,500 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each. The tree has to grow to make room for more beehives. Growth happen when enough drops of nectar have been brought to the tree by the bees:\n</p>\n<ul><li>When 4,000 drops of nectar have been brought, a second beehive is added and three more bees can be purchased for 2,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each.</li>\n<li>At 40,000 drops a third beehive is added and three more bees can be purchased for 2,500 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each.</li>\n<li>At 400,000 drops, a fourth and last beehive is added and three more bees can be purchased for 3,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> each.</li></ul>\n<p>Honey bees can be bought from the <a href=\"/wiki/shop-14324\" title=\"Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Shop</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Harvesting</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/88/Skep.png/revision/latest?cb=20191025204403\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Skep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Skep\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Skep</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Honey bees make honeycomb by flying to <a href=\"/wiki/nectar-bush-15746\" title=\"Nectar Bush\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nectar bushes</a>, collecting drops of nectar -one per bee- then flying them back to the beehive. It takes approximately 35 minutes to get enough nectar to make honeycomb, providing bushes are as close as possible to the beehive tree and there are enough bushes to get nectar from. Players can then collect it from the tree.\n</p><p>Bees collect nectar even players are offline -distance does not matter then- but stop doing so when all beehives are full.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Tutorial</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"> <a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AHay_Day_Introducing_the_Bees\" class=\"video video-thumbnail medium\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"> \t<img alt=\"Hay_Day_Introducing_the_Bees\" height=\"196\" width=\"350\" class=\"lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"> \t<span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"> \t\t\t</span> </a> <figcaption>Hay Day tutorial about bees.</figcaption></figure>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/chicken-2409\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a3/Chicken.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025192121\" title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Chicken (213 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/cow-2488\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/84/Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025194659\" title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Cow (241 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/duck-16989\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/38/Duck.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150713101647\" title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Duck (806 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/fish-5891\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Sockeye_Salmon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20150711153706\" title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Fish (224 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/goat-2346\" title=\"Goat (319 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/52/Goat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191025202216\" title=\"Goat (319 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Goat (319 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/honey-bee-15814\" title=\"Honey Bee (160 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c3/Honey_Bee.png/revision/latest/scale-t